- `frontend/src/pages/company/CompanyJobs.tsx` — navegacao para detalhes e candidatos

### Acceptance criteria covered by this task

- AC-4: fluxo E2E de candidatura (application.spec.ts)
- AC-5: fluxo E2E de visualizacao de candidatos (hiring.spec.ts)
- AC-7: testes rodam headless sem erros em 3 execucoes consecutivas

